ATE MONEY MACHINE!!\n\n💖 Made with love by Ocean Games","path":"/game/9666226803-motel-simulator","slug":"9666226803-motel-simulator","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/d68daf297b46265f6bc14962b2142ddb6a9b84a3377ed257f6de5dd86976e4c5.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-59622c612faeef9cd1e6045f14546ea2/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":29116803,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-10-13T10:03:58.901Z","creator":{"name":"Ocean Gamеs","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":9903808883,"name":"[CO-OP] Build a Market Tycoon","desc":"👍 NEW CODE Releasing at 50K LIKES! 👍 \r\n🎮 Brought to you by Voldex! 🎮\r\n\r\nWelcome to Build a Market! Manage your own market by growing fresh plants, keeping your animals fed and happy, selling to customers, and hiring employees to expand your store! Unlock new items to sell and continue to build your market!\r\n\r\n🛒  Build the Biggest Market!\r\n🌻  Grow Crops and Tend to Animals!\r\n💸  Collect the Most Money to Hire Workers!\r\n👥  Visit your Friend's Markets!\r\n🏬  Expand your Market Corporation!\r\n\r\n⚒️ Updates Every Week! Lastest Update ⚒️\r\n - Thief event!\r\n- Overflowing bin market event!\r\n- Goat mount for market 2 completion!\r\nInspired by My Mini Mart mobile game\r\n\r\nTags: Mini, Shelf, Stacking, Job, Tycoon, Supermarket, Market, Store, Voldex","path":"/game/9903808883-build-a-market-tycoon","slug":"9903808883-build-a-market-tycoon","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/c87f7e2f13e6e186371f7940dbfb4220ea0fdb03eb09d16d7770a9fdbbaf2405.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-89974576882f780c80d0f26928131be8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":2,"visitor":27615182,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-07-30T15:35:19.460Z","creator":{"name":"Build a Market","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":15766161869,"name":"[EVENT] HACK AN EVIL CROCODILE","desc":"","path":"/game/15